The packaged code reader
https://github.com/Sec-ant/barcode-detector
https://github.com/Sec-ant/zxing-wasm
https://github.com/zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp

The web interface this package embeds reads codes with the camera, in
browsers with no BarcodeDetector of their own, with the barcode-detector
npm package, over zxing-wasm's build of zxing-cpp as WebAssembly. Both
are pinned in web/package.json, and the WebAssembly is built into
static/app/assets and served by bam itself (docs/scanning.md).

